        <mxCell id="note" value="Notes&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; All API amounts are in &lt;b&gt;rial&lt;/b&gt;; the client converts from toman.&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; pspCode is the PSP the user selected.&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; The Payment is saved &lt;b&gt;before&lt;/b&gt; the token request so its Id can be used as ResNum.&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; Token failure is &lt;b&gt;not&lt;/b&gt; an exception: the Failed state is saved and a JsonResponse failure is returned.&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; The API returns the IPG URL as JSON; the client navigates (no server-side 302)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="1760" width="1320" height="130" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
